---
title: dentry 缓存路径查找
type: flowchart
tags: [文件系统, VFS, dentry, dcache]
description: 路径分量查找时优先命中 dentry cache 否则走慢路径调用 inode_operations 的 lookup 读目录块
---
flowchart TD
    Start[link_path_walk 逐级遍历路径] --> WalkComponent[walk_component 处理单个路径分量]
    WalkComponent --> LookupFast[lookup_fast 快速查找 dcache]
    LookupFast --> |cache 命中| Hit[直接返回已缓存 dentry]
    LookupFast --> |cache 未命中| LookupSlow[lookup_slow 慢速路径]
    LookupSlow --> LookupSlowCore[__lookup_slow 分配并设置 dentry]
    LookupSlowCore --> IopLookup[inode->i_op->lookup 回调]
    IopLookup --> Ext4Lookup[ext4_lookup 具体文件系统查找]
    Ext4Lookup --> Ext4Entry[ext4_lookup_entry 读目录块查找目录项]
    Ext4Entry --> FillInode[找到目录项后填充 inode 信息]
    FillInode --> AddCache[加入 dcache 并返回 dentry]
    Hit --> Next[继续下一个路径分量或结束]
    AddCache --> Next
